{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">VR Helsing, is a virtual reality Boomer Shooter set in the Victorian era, where darkness and supernatural horrors lurk around every corner. Armed with a pistol and melee combat skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540160/extras/HeartGif.gif?t=1741890216\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as the legendary monster hunter Van Helsing, who years after his retirement is forced to return as the monsters he hunted in the past have come back for revenge. The player will face fearsome classic creatures such as Frankenstein or Dracula, in frenetic combats using objects in the scenario to their advantage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy a Low Poly Pixel art Monochromatic visual style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master your mobility with the grappling hook by taking advantage of the verticality of the scenery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expand your arsenal to annihilate enemies in unique ways</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540160/extras/GunGIf.gif?t=1741890216\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3540160?t=1741890216","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3540160?t=1741890216","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540160/eef5d2e5014352d04053c69a6c3987dc18801c47/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741890216","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540160/eef5d2e5014352d04053c69a6c3987dc18801c47/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741890